#NEXUS
[HAND-MADE TEST FILE (not real data). Multi-tree NEXUS with TAXA + TRANSLATE, [&R]/[&U] flags,
 quoted labels with spaces and apostrophes, internal labels and support values, a polytomy.]
BEGIN TAXA;
  DIMENSIONS NTAX=7;
  TAXLABELS
    'Puma concolor'
    Panthera_leo
    'Lynx rufus (Bobcat)'
    'O''Brien''s fox'
    Canis_lupus
    Vulpes_vulpes
    Ursus_arctos
